# Normalize line endings so the working tree matches the committed blobs.
#
# Without this, git checks out CRLF on Windows while the repository stores LF,
# so every tracked file shows as modified and `git diff` is pure noise.
# `text=auto` lets git auto-detect text vs binary, so images, .jar, .keystore
# and other platform binaries are left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
